_id":"11cc-c95f-19f0-45e2"},{"link_uuid":"ae59a026-b504-429d-ae63-2be191d198ad","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"92cf-7266-f8d5-44bc"},{"link_uuid":"09f26887-d1fb-45d1-9bac-7fabee557864","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"f1c8-fab8-5374-4ee1"},{"link_uuid":"f2ff3cec-6117-4f55-97fe-38d0492efb27","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"2e03-9a5e-7288-4b13"},{"link_uuid":"b427cbaa-3c5c-4d42-b758-78ce8938c9c7","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"4dad-78f5-2c69-49c7"},{"link_uuid":"522fbfd8-d117-478e-b021-65563d600052","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"46e6-beca-faba-42ee"},{"link_uuid":"5dca3b95-1248-4988-805f-9037fab7c15e","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"0fa2-38f7-9f1f-4c35"},{"link_uuid":"919ba05a-5d8e-4e8b-8762-649382197e91","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"7a97-9d9f-0e36-4ab7"},{"link_uuid":"d94a1025-7e3f-45b9-837f-acc7d7b2f940","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"5419-6d7e-7e34-4b18"},{"link_uuid":"b69e5399-ddaf-49ce-ac5a-0c58753c5d17","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"cad0-1a74-8d2e-468f"},{"link_uuid":"15b0c955-a5df-49cf-a25e-42f5f51e21e7","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"e518-407c-2f9f-43f6"},{"link_uuid":"0d255a46-1c93-4272-beed-7661dac2ef02","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"f4ad-a1c7-6d70-4b54"},{"link_uuid":"6fd9e5fc-148d-4fa4-be66-233e86858b79","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"3260-3106-97fc-410f"},{"link_uuid":"00efb261-3831-4ec5-8cfc-d6018450986c","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"b5c5-64c6-3474-46ee"},{"link_uuid":"396ca514-e44c-4547-8b63-16d7592e7e9a","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"6c59-24e6-5d79-4cd0"},{"link_uuid":"069f7b3e-dddc-477e-b392-cfb1ad9cf25d","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"8487-7acd-bd31-4bbf"},{"link_uuid":"090c9031-d360-414c-b826-4fcac46115c4","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"f712-d6db-21a2-48d9"},{"link_uuid":"30719991-e416-4c6c-8e68-3e57314053d3","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"de06-bcd5-d259-489e"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nThe src/rebar/_commands cohort contains audited comments or docstrings that obscure current behavior with repetition, obvious narration, duplicated explanation, or historical detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `src/rebar/_commands/doctor_mcp_client.py:1-33` — Preserve the two actionable client-wiring failure classes. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_commands/doctor.py:1-44` — Preserve diagnostic-versus-repair boundary and non-destructive guarantees. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_commands/fsck_authorship.py:1-28, 101-107` — Preserve per-environment tally purpose and identity-divergence data. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_commands/fsck_repair.py:1-19, 44-109, 313-317, 604-740` — Preserve orphan classification, incomplete-log refusal, dry-run, and human-triage boundaries. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_commands/fsck_restore.py:25-34, 61-96, 130-196` — Preserve newest-deletion selection, per-path fallback, retired-file restoration, and incomplete-log refusal. Consumer: test coverage asserts the related recovery documentation retains `get_rotation.json`.\n- `src/rebar/_commands/fsck_scan.py:1-21, 56-93, 128-176, 261-267, 319-412` — Preserve check ownership, counted/report-only distinctions, and snapshot/orphan rules. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_commands/fsck_tracker_health.py:1-18, 38-55, 112-158, 289-313` — Preserve tracker-level checks, shared pollution classifier, and dirty-tree classes. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_commands/fsck.py:1-24, 84-101, 302-456` — Preserve command ownership, counted-versus-report-only semantics, and parser governance. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_commands/gates.py:1-21, 44-112, 143-243, 294-446` — Preserve current gate states, exemptions, local-only validation, and fail-closed behavior. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_commands/identity.py:1-15, 285-360, 462-537, 626-633` — Preserve entity fields, resolve-or-mint idempotence, key lifecycle, and current-identity precedence. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_commands/init.py:1-15, 27-72, 189-230, 416-524` — Preserve bootstrap outputs, cold-fetch rationale, ensure order, and consent predicates. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_commands/lifecycle_cascade.py:1-25, 47-90` — Preserve ancestor lifecycle invariant, cycle guard, and benign-race condition. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_commands/metrics.py:1-19` — Preserve command responsibility and fault-isolation behavior. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_commands/recent_creates.py:1-28, 137-144` — Preserve normalized-title/window logic, journal ordering, and advisory gating. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_commands/session_id.py:1-24` — Preserve resolution precedence and the explicit never-HEAD rule. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_commands/session_log.py:1-18, 49-57` — Preserve rotation/pointer semantics and shared session resolver. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_commands/tracker_maintenance.py:1-33` — Preserve supported-door safety envelope, backup, audit, and human-only force policy. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_commands/transition_close.py:1-14, 137-228, 313-396, 447-518, 591-740` — Preserve ref pinning, sign/record ordering, best-effort blame, nonblocking compaction trigger, and close-gate exclusions. Consumer: none found.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make test`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/doctor_mcp_client.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/doctor.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/fsck_authorship.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/fsck_repair.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/fsck_restore.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/fsck_scan.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/fsck_tracker_health.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/fsck.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/gates.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/identity.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/init.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/lifecycle_cascade.py","reason":"Condense com